        <mxCell id="statusNote" value="&lt;b&gt;Main status transitions in code&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;PENDING + approve -&amp;gt; PROCESSING&lt;br&gt;PROCESSING + approve -&amp;gt; SHIPPING&lt;br&gt;Reject/cancel -&amp;gt; CANCELLED + returnStock(order)&lt;br&gt;SHIPPING + confirm receipt -&amp;gt; COMPLETED&lt;br&gt;SHIPPING/COMPLETED + return -&amp;gt; RETURNING&lt;br&gt;RETURNING + inspect -&amp;gt; INSPECTION&lt;br&gt;INSPECTION + returned -&amp;gt; RETURNED + returnStock(order)" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;darkOpacity=0.05;strokeColor=#000000;fillColor=#fff2cc;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;" parent="1" vertex="1">
